  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "醫學量測",
    "sub_ename": "MEASUREMENTS IN BIOMEDICAL SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "以模組化的課程設計，系統化地讓學生了解生醫訊號與醫學量測的關連以及相關應用。主題涵蓋了生醫訊號的特性與種類、生醫感測元件的種類與應用、醫學量測設備儀器簡介等。課程並配合逢甲大學自控系的師資專長與實驗設備，進一步安排模組化的應用課程，包含：1.血流與血管特性量測，2.腦波量測與應用，3.生理訊號量測與健康照護，4.語音訊號與中醫應用，5.心電訊號量測，6.醫學影像與生醫訊號，7.呼吸訊號與呼吸器，8.腦血流調控之量測與臨床病症。",
    "describe_eh": "This aim of this course is to convey the fundamentals of biomedical signals and their relationship to medical measurements and applications to clinical medicines. The subject includes the classification and characteristics of biomedical signals, the basis and application of biomedical sensoring devices, and introduction to medical measurement devices. To further courses with faculty expertise and laboratory equipment, the course is also modularized with several application studies:\n 1.Measurement of the Instantaneous Arterial Blood Pressure\n 2.EEG measurement and applications\n 3.Assessment of physiological signals and health care\n 4.Electrocardiogram signals\n 5.Medical images and biomedical signals\n 6.Respiratory signals and mechanical ventilator\n 7.Assessment of cerebral autoregulation and clinical symptoms",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能運用數學基礎，以了解生醫訊號與醫學量測的基本知識。",
      "describe_en": "Apply mathematic foundation to understand the basic knowledge about biomedical signal measurement."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "理解生理訊號與醫學量測的定義與定理。",
      "describe_en": "Comprehension for the definitions or theories of biomedical signal measurement."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "對醫療器材具備描述問題，應用現有工具，對生理訊號與醫學量測完成分析與設計",
      "describe_en": "With analysis capability on describing problems, and application for the available tools to the analysis and design of biomedical signal measurement."
    }
  ],
